10. Expected Outcome

At the end of the project, PocketSmart AI will provide a simple platform where users can enter their income and expenses, monitor their budget, track savings, understand their spending habits, and receive AI-generated personalized recommendations.

11. Planning Phase Conclusion

The Planning Phase establishes a clear roadmap for developing PocketSmart AI. By defining the objectives, scope, modules, technologies, resources, schedule, and risks, the project can be developed systematically and efficiently.
